      "title": "Uniswap V2 Audit Report",
      "description": "dapp.org code review, numerical error analysis and K-framework formal verification (act specifications of UniswapV2Pair and UniswapV2Factory) of the Uniswap V2 core contracts in uniswap-v2-core at commit 8160750, where all core issues found during the January-April 2020 engagement were addressed, plus a cursory best-effort review of the uniswap-v2-periphery contracts (UniswapV2Router01) while they were still under development on master. Two Medium-severity bugs (a liquidity-deflation race condition in the Pair, whose fix the findings table attributes to core commit cbe801b5, and the Router's incompatibility with fee-on-transfer tokens) and one Low bug were found; no Major/Critical findings.",
